silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_01_sections_02_concrete_anchor_7#eventbatchdietarycard silm:hasLongDescription "The EventBatchDietaryCard is the candidate batch admitted at the 2026-04-26 dietary card event. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'E'', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
